  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Shelter and Non Food Items</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Shelter and Non Food Items</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will respond to the major increase in shelter needs, extensive damage to housing units and consequent prolonged displacement resulting from ISF incursions and armed confrontations in refugee camps. UNRWA will support 500 households in rehabilitating their shelters through a self-help approach. A further 100 homes will be reconstructed, 
also through a self-help approach, with families receiving rental subsidies as a temporary measure whilst homes are being reconstructed.</narrative>
